From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 1ma <hello@1ma.ai>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 19:11:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 1ma: the usage card opens on All locations, every
 subscription in one list

The usage card showed one location at a time: a machine's own provider
logins, or a shared source such as Account Pooler. A subscription that only
the pool holds was invisible on the machine view, and the pool view left out
the machine's other providers, so no single view listed every subscription.
When there is more than one location, the server now also offers All
locations: every account from shared sources and connected machines, with an
account whose provider-issued identity is known listed once (the shared
source's reading wins, as within a location). The card and the settings page
open on it; the selection key moves to v2 so a remembered location gives way
to it once. Picking a machine or a source works as before.
---
